(   [Problem Statement]: Explain the concept of laser speckle and Electronic Speckle Pattern Interferometry \(ESPI\). How is it used to detect internal micro-cracks in concrete structures?) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Physical Origin of Laser Speckle:) Tj
T*
(   - When highly coherent laser light illuminates an optically rough surface \(roughness > lambda,) Tj
T*
(   such as concrete, rock, or masonry\), scattered wavelets from myriad microscopic surface) Tj
T*
(   irregularities interfere mutually in space.) Tj
